    <mxCell id="questions" value="&lt;b&gt;Open questions and assumptions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;&amp;#8226; D-07: no copies of another domain's data unless a written decision says why&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; D-11: loyalty and wallet stay per brand; O-19 and O-20 (cross-brand wallet and points) are deferred&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; The sync-call list shows the calls named in the reference flows and topic rules; each domain's own diagrams hold the rest&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D97706;" vertex="1" parent="1">
